{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792441440, "covers_from": "2026-10-19T20:24:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-19T20:25:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792441500, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-19T20:24:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 67616, "sprite_key": "turtle_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "長照", "content": "大湖公園健身房承包商一直換難建立穩定環境。這邊有很多長輩，希望有固定廠商、更多的銀髮健身課程幫助增肌", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.67,616", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T20:24:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 17174, "sprite_key": "turtle_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "長照", "content": "長輩想搭計程車就醫，常常叫不到車，發現是：這類叫車，司機要多負擔2%手續。請問：有辦法改善嗎？", "display_name": "北投代表 No.17,174", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T20:24:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 66318, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "測試測試", "display_name": "松山代表 No.66,318", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T20:24:35+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 42037, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "環保局，下水道都沒有在清，都敷衍了事，一下雨，就淹水啦", "display_name": "松山代表 No.42,037", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T20:24:44+00:00", "duration_seconds": 16, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 43634, "sprite_key": "elephant_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "治安", "content": "大眾交通或捷運上違規飲食，應該有option可直接經檢舉開罰，否則違規飲食，來不及開罰。勸導太消極", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.43,634", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 17174, "sprite_key": "turtle_suburb", "display_name": "北投代表 No.17,174", "district": "beitou", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 66318, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.66,318", "district": "songshan", "is_repl